<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher Friday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 585.41, up 0.05.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 279 to 272.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 24,116,885, compared with 22,588,850 Thursday.</p>
<p>	    (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
